{
  "description": "This protocol moves up to 384 samples from 1 source plate to 1 destination plate using a P50-multichannel GEN1 pipette. The source plate is a Greiner Bio-One 384-well plate, and the destination plate can be either a Corning 384-well plate or a Bio-Rad 384-well plate. Samples are transferred across row A (A1, C1, E1, G1, I1, K1, M1, O1; A2, C2, E2, G2, I2, K2, M2, O2; etc.), then across row B (B1, D1, F1, H1, J1, L1, N1, P1; B2, D2, F2, H2, J2, L2, N2, P2; etc.).\n\n\nTo purchase tips, reagents, or pipettes, please visit our online store or contact our sales team at info@opentrons.com\n\nOpentrons OT-2\nOpentrons OT-2 Run App (Version 4.0.0 or later)\nOpentrons P50 Multi-Channel Pipette GEN1\nOpentrons 96 Tiprack 300ul\nGreiner Bio-One 384 Well Plate 100 µL #781720\nCorning 384 Well Plate 20 µL #4511\nBio-Rad 384 Well Plate 50 µL #HSR4801\n\nFor more detailed information on compatible labware, please visit our Labware Library.",
  "tags": [
    "normalization.ot2.apiv2.py",
    "Sample Prep",
    "Plate Filling"
  ],
